    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be lafordleasum mannum.] [B] Ond we cwædon be þam hlafordleasan mannum, ðe mon nán ryht ætbegytan ne mæg, þæt mon beode ðære mægþe, ðæt hi hine to folcryhte gehamette ⁊ him hlaford finden on folcgemote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">With regard to lordless men from whom no [legal] satisfaction can be obtained, we have delared that their relatives shall be commanded to settle them in a fixed residence where they will become amenable to public law, and find them a lord at a public meeting.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be lafordleasum mannum. And we cwædon be ðam hlafordleasum mannum, ðe nan man nan riht ætbegytan ne mæg, þæt man bude ðære mægðe, þæt hi hine to rihte gehamette ⁊ him hlaford fundon on folcgemote.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
